===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ine-bsl-pro|lt}} {{m|ine-bsl-pro|*śwō}}, {{m|ine-bsl-pro|*śō}} (compare Latvian {{term|suns|lang=lv}}, Old Prussian {{term|sunnis|lang=prg}}), from {{etyl|ine-pro|lt}} {{m|ine-pro|*ḱwṓ}}. Cognate to Armenian {{term|շուն|lang=hy|tr=šun|sc=Armn}}, Sanskrit {{term|श्वन्|tr=śvā́|lang=sa|sc=Deva}}.

